# Caelo Theme Design

Any UI / visual / Figma / CSS / component / sportsbook styling must follow this file. Do not invent a parallel palette.

**Detailed snapshot:** [docs/CAELO_THEME_REFERENCE.md](docs/CAELO_THEME_REFERENCE.md)  
**Runtime CSS:** `src/theme.css` + `src/styles/theme.css`  
**Sportsbook remap:** `public/sportsbook/css/caelo-palette.css` (load last)  
**Token naming:** `VARIABLE-RULES.md`

## Brand look

- **Skin:** Caelo blue / white light UI + **gold CTA** — never CAM88 or Riocity green/gray as product skin
- **Font:** Poppins → `--font-family-primary` / `--font-family-sans`

| Role | Hex | Token |
|------|-----|--------|
| Primary / nav | `#123B94` | `--color-primary` / `--color-brand-primary` |
| Secondary / deep | `#0d2a6a` / `#01206C` | `--color-brand-secondary` / `--color-brand-deep` |
| Soft panels | `#E5F6FF` / `#eff6ff` / `#dbeafe` | `--color-brand-soft` / `--color-accent-50` / `--color-accent-100` |
| Accent fill | `#60a5fa` → `#2563eb` | `--color-accent-400` / `--color-accent-600` |
| CTA gold | `#ffcf4a` → `#ffb22d` | `--color-cta-start` / `--color-cta-end` / `--color-button-cta` |
| CTA text | `#0c4a8e` | `--color-cta-text` / `--color-text-cta-inverse` |
| Nav accent | `#ffd84d` | `--color-nav-accent` / `--color-accent` |
| Surface / ink | `#ffffff` / `#0f172a` | `--color-surface-base` / `--color-text-strong` |
| Muted text | `#64748b` | `--color-text-muted` |
| Border | `#e2e8f0` / `#cfe0f9` | `--color-border-default` / `--color-border-brand` |

## App (light UI) rules

- Use semantic `var(--color-*)` only — no hardcoded hex, no `--mono-*` in UI
- Light promo/VIP progress track: **`--color-accent-100` (`#dbeafe`)** — not `--color-surface-muted`
- Prefer theme classes (`.soft-blue-panel`, `.btn-theme-cta-soft`, promo/balance) over one-off styles
- Preserve brand tokens on pull/merge; spot-check nav `#123B94`, promo track `#dbeafe`, CTA gold

## Sportsbook (`/sportsbook`)

Keep 1xbet **dark chrome structure** for the night skin; retint via `caelo-palette.css` only:

| 1xbet role | Remap to |
|------------|----------|
| Sky / header blues | Caelo brand `#123B94` / accent `#2563eb` |
| Cyan accents / selected odds | Gold / amber `#ffb22d` / `#e89a12` + CTA text `#0c4a8e` |
| Lime conversion CTAs | Gold gradient `#ffcf4a` → `#ffb22d` + text `#0c4a8e` |
| Soft cyan links | Nav accent gold `#ffd84d` |

Do **not** ship raw 1xbet/Figma chrome hex (`#1d4268`, `#205583`, `#276aa5`, `#7eac2f`, etc.) as the product palette. Structure/icons OK; fills/borders/text must hit Caelo tokens above. Success/win green may stay readable (`#65a30d`) — do not force orange onto win states.

**Default is white.** Use the sun/moon toggle beside **Download App** to compare white vs dark. Do not add `(Light)` routes to Sports / Live / Esports menus.

**White / light sportsbook:** `/sportsbook/light` is the default white-chrome sportsbook (`caelo-light.css` last). Additional white routes reuse the same dark-page layouts with `light` + `body.sportsbook-light` + `.sportsbook-light-chrome` + `caelo-light.css`:

- `/sportsbook/light`
- `/sportsbook/light/national-team`
- `/sportsbook/light/live-national-team`
- `/sportsbook/light/big-tournaments`
- `/sportsbook/light/long-term-bets`
- `/sportsbook/light/multi-live`
- `/sportsbook/light/marble-live`
- `/sportsbook/light/fast-bet`
- `/sportsbook/light/esports`

Night skin stays on `/sportsbook` and `/sportsbook/<slug>`. Do **not** fold the light skin into `caelo-palette.css`. Table heads / toolbars: white/soft panels, navy text, gold CTA; inactive tabs must stay readable on white (`--text-muted`).

```text
✅ var(--color-primary), var(--color-accent-100), var(--color-button-cta)
✅ sportsbook accents via caelo-palette.css tokens
❌ Hardcoded fighting hex / purple-indigo AI defaults / Riocity green skin
```

After intentional theme changes, update this rule and `docs/CAELO_THEME_REFERENCE.md`.
